<p> </p>

<p><span>Wearing the White Tiger is not about overpowering others. It is about reminding oneself of discipline, perseverance, and the ability to stay clear-headed amidst external changes.</span></p>
<p><span>For creators, the White Tiger is the steel frame that keeps the journey on track.</span><span><br></span><span>For the disciplined, it is the representative symbol: clear, calm, needing no explanation.</span></p>
<p><span>Wear it not for others to see. Wear it to remember for yourself.</span></p>
